    "text": "CONDUCTING THE SPECIAL ELECTION OF OFFICE - BEARERS AS PER THE CEYLON RAILWAYDAILY PAID WORKERS' BENEVOLENT ASSOCIATION ACT BEARING THE No. 03 OF 1965",
