      48.0,
      488.16,
      542.5,
      549.63
    ],
    "text": "IN accordance with the powers vested in the Secretary to the Ministry of Transport, Highways and Urban Development under the Section 30(A) 1 of the Ceylon Railway Daily Paid Workers\u2019 Benevolent Association Act bearing the No. 03 of 1965, the Extra Ordinary Gazette No. 2429/36, issued on 27.03.2025, is hereby revoked and the approval has been granted to appoint the board of new office-bearers through the letter of the Secretary to the Ministry of Transport, Highways and Urban Development bearing the No. MT/03/05/21/17-1-1 Volume (\u0dad\u0dcf\u0dc0) and dated 17.11.2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "IskoolaPota",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      560.16,
      542.48,
      585.63
    ],
    "text": "02. Accordingly, it is notified that it is as follows the board of the officers elected by the members\u2019 votes at the 49th special election of the office-bearers, held on 21.09.2025.",
